  "prompt": "Repaint this existing Orange SMP Kitchen item as a native 16x16 vanilla Minecraft item sprite, matching the pixel density of vanilla items like wheat seeds, sugar and bread. Same subject: A warm ivory paper seed packet with folded seams, a ripe orange and fresh green leaf illustration, and two small orange seeds. Crisp vanilla pixel art with upper-left lighting and a clean transparent background. Keep the original palette and silhouette, simplified to 16x16: clean dark outline, upper-left lighting, 2-3 shade steps per material, no noise or dithering, no letters, transparent background. Drop details that cannot stay legible at 16x16.",
